'''Plasma Energy''' (Japanese: '''プラズマエネルギー''' ''Plasma Energy'') is a {{TCG|Special Energy card}}. It was first released as part of the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{Cardtext/Header|type=Colorless|class=Plasma}}
{{Cardtext/Team Plasma}}
{{Cardtext/Energy
|type=Colorless
|effect=This card provides {{e|Colorless}} Energy.
}}
{{Cardtext/Footer}}

==Release information==
This card was released in the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion, first originating from the Japanese {{TCG|Plasma Gale}} expansion. In Japan, it was reprinted in the {{TCG|Team Plasma's Powered Half Deck}}, the {{TCG|Black Kyurem-EX Battle Strength Deck|Black Kyurem-EX}} and {{TCG|White Kyurem-EX Battle Strength Deck}}s, and the {{TCG|Team Plasma Battle Gift Set}}. Plasma Energy was reprinted in the {{TCG|Plasma Freeze}} expansion, originating from the Japanese {{TCG|Spiral Force}} and {{TCG|Thunder Knuckle}} expansions, and again in the {{TCG|Plasma Blast}} expansion, originating from the Japanese {{TCG|Megalo Cannon}} expansion.

==Trivia==
* Like {{TCG ID|EX Legend Maker|React Energy|82}}, Plasma Energy provides a single unit of Colorless Energy with no additional effects on its own. However, there are a number of {{TCG|Team Plasma}} cards that interact with Plasma Energy in some way, like {{TCG ID|Plasma Blast|Porygon-Z|74}}, {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Lugia-EX|108}}, or {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Plasma Frigate|124}}.

